{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-01",
  "title": "鬼魂危机",
  "storyCode": "9-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e5dd96077b07d8ef4e2398d532a53041c022e8f778ac7982f1631c623f38b4e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小丘郡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中型移动城市，距离伦蒂尼姆不远不近，以农业与轻工业为支柱产业，与周围各郡的联系并不紧密——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和情报里描绘的完全一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outcast，你是不是到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚到一分钟。你是在我身上安了追踪器吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一晚上呼叫了你十几次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在荒地赶路，信号自然不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，成吧。先说好，不是我着急，这都是Misery在催我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他的性格你清楚，总是担心这担心那的。要我说，他不放心我就算了，连你出任务都这么操心，他怎么还没有多长几条皱纹啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——倘若他不是这样的人，他就不叫Misery了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有道理。正经地说，你觉得这座城市怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那情报会不会出错了啊，像这种规模的城市，在维多利亚起码有三四十座——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伦蒂尼姆的太阳再怎么耀眼，都总有照不到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也看过资料，应该知道，小丘郡的管辖权目前并不在任何一位大贵族手上。有两位伯爵对这座移动城市表示过兴趣，却均未付诸行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，因为这地方没什么油水可赚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，或许正是因为它的普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而越是貌似普通的角落，就越容易潜藏暗流。无论罗德岛决定何时动身，这都是个一探前路的好机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，需要我接应的话，随时说。我刚准备动身去康纳郡，现在离你还很近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安置感染者的工作可不轻松。比起你们的工作，我只是来跑跑腿而已，说不定大半时间都在办事处里喝茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你别骗我，风暴当前，像你这样的萨科塔会甘于喝茶？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我也想好好地过退休生活啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我怎么就不信呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算啦，还是各自干完活，早点回家吧。Outcast，我记得还有好几个萨科塔的新干员等着你上射击课？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，他们偶尔也需要一些自习时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有，虽然我知道没什么必要，但这是Misery逼我说的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请小心，Outcast，但愿前路没有危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有......危险吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Outcast",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_245_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，这样的地方，恐怕不太适合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:50 A.M. 天气/阴\n维多利亚小丘郡驻军营地审讯室，走廊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，这地方好闷啊，一点都不透气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去年在仓库城讯问连环爆炸案嫌疑人的时候，你也这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再来多少次也不习惯啊。队长，你还不如叫大提琴一起来。她那两米高的个头，至少能把对面吓得老实一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "换你当着嫌疑人的面把铁制的桌子一拳砸穿也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈，哈哈......我一时没控制住。那家伙挟持了俩小孩，还对死者家属阴阳怪气，队长你当时不也很生气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把他脖子上的禁锢装置捏出了手指印。那家伙当场吓得尿了裤子，哆哆嗦嗦地把同伙名字和炸弹坐标全交代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这大部分是队长的功劳吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是必要的审讯手段罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，这些什么手段啦我都不太行，我的讯问学基础理论课是勉强才考过的，平时作业也都是抄我好朋友的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那正好，反正今天我们的首要任务是在一旁听着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对哦！不过队长，不是马上就到点了吗？为什么没人过来带我们进去？那个上尉不是通知我们审讯是从七点开始吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还有四分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请问凯利上尉在吗？我们和他约好在这里见面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是否在七点有一场审讯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨天下午有一名当地男性因涉嫌走私非法源石制品被捕。你是否知道他被关押在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这位朋友一问三不知哎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，小丘郡的时间或许和伦蒂尼姆的时间有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，有这回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少对这位凯利上尉来说是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来我们只好入乡随俗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经过去十分钟了哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "频繁看时间也不会使我们的同僚来得更快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚好，我得和你谈谈昨天那场并未真正发生的战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？队长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你别想就这么糊弄过去。我问你，当我下令回撤的时候，你为什么要扑向那个货箱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，你当时喊的不是其他人回撤吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在进入仓库之前，你对我下的命令是一定要活捉嫌疑人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是最初的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，命令就是命令吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，当时我们都以为嫌疑人引爆了炸弹，对不对？我的判断是只有我有机会完成这项任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我能挡住冲击波，就能保住嫌疑人的命，同时你们也更安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，我不是质疑队长你的盾啦......上次你在萨尔贡雇佣兵的高爆炮弹轰炸下救了我，我可不会忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想说的不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果，我是说如果，那货箱里装的真是炸弹，你可能会受重伤，甚至丢掉性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？不会的吧。遭窃的那批源石制品里没有很高规格的爆破品，就算有人私自改造，威力也不会超过我们实战演习时用的破城弹呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我的身体还扛得住啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作战时候不要过度依赖瓦伊凡的身体素质。这句话我对你说过多少次了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......五次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我觉得起码有十次。我相信斯利姆老师一定也教过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教过......的吧？哈，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的笑脸对我不起作用。我是你的队长。我要对手底下每个人的安危负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起，队长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等回去以后，你知道怎么做吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叫我跑圈没问题......可是队长，我还是好想吃晚饭啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有时候，我也不知道该拿你怎么办。风笛，你是我手下最出色的战士。除了优秀的作战能力，你对遵循命令的执拗也......总能超出预期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那必须呀！小时候妈妈就说过，“瓦伊凡的女人一定要坚持到底”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算顶着狂风大雨也没啥，要是不能在麦子全被淋湿前把它们都收好，宝贵的粮食可是会发霉的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我并不是在夸你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了。就算我再怎么摆臭脸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也很难改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相信我，队长，你的脸完全不够凶......那种瞪着明亮的双眼阴森森地用最恶劣的维多利亚粗口放狠话的人我见惯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，这种没有意义的好话不会对一名合格的维多利亚军人产生作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......非这样不可吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "达米安他......不，我是说巴里，他从小是个老实孩子，我向您保证，他顶多就是误入歧途......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉。是的，我会遵守命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，那些伦蒂尼姆来的人还在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了。我会吩咐下去的，长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯利上尉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_238",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请您放心。我时刻记得，我首先是一名......维多利亚士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，队长，你又在看时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不像你，能不分场合地发呆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，老实说，我在想那个仓库里的菲林。我还蛮喜欢他唱的歌的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道为什么，我想象了一下，这首歌很适合边开拖拉机边唱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“冬眠的山驮着成群的牧兽~”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他在瞪我耶。是我唱得走调了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你记错歌词了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢！不是牧兽吗？那是房子？还是翻土机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边站着的小丘郡的朋友，你知道这首歌的歌词应该是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不该在这里唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，这违反你们的规定了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少，不要在我们面前唱那群人唱的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那群人？哪群人？我不懂你在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在羞辱我吗，瓦伊凡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？你为什么要生气呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......风笛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总觉得哪里奇奇怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在不是闲聊的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我不是在说这个......队长，我好像听见里面也有人在唱歌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阴暗的走廊深处传来了同样的调子，更低沉、更粗糙，时不时被几声猛烈的咳嗽打断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人是不是就在里面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你们不能进去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿！你——你是昨天在郊外仓库里被抓的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......哈......你说达米安吗？可怜的达米安......他早就被带走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？！什么时候啊？我们怎么不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他被带去了哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪里......哈哈哈......你们问去了哪里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他已经......已经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闭嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是说你也想和他一个下场？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在威胁他。你为什么要威胁他？昨天来的那个人到底去了哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的青年",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......哈......他回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回......家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他被释放啦？难道他真的和鬼魂部队没有关系？队长——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......让我进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "未经允许，你们不能和犯人交谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要见凯利上尉。让开，士兵。我知道他就在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你？你是仓库里那个骂人的副官，我记得你。你想说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上尉有急事离开了，他让我来转告你们一声——审讯在一个小时以前就结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......！你的意思是，你们把错误的时间告诉了我们？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沟通失误。在哪里都不算罕见，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说什么沟通失误啦......当我们是傻子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，他们玩传假消息这招，把我们套进去了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这不是关键。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我问你，士兵，为什么现在你出面告诉我们这信息？既然已经耽搁这么久，你们一定不介意让我们浪费更多时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "关于您的这项疑问......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声汇报）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯卡曼德罗斯中尉，我接到的命令是把以下消息告知您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "犯人达米安·巴里，也就是您十分关心的那位——已在十分钟前，因在押送途中试图抢夺武器、袭击士兵而被击毙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你在胡说什么啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们见过那个青年，他就是个普通人呀，他见到我们的时候吓得都不怎么敢动，怎么可能主动攻击全副武装的军人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也就是说，你们未经审判，直接处决了嫌疑人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "副官希尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_248",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经向您传达了事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，我们被阴了。他们为什么不让我们和嫌疑人接触？我们不是站在同一边的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在还不清楚他们的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唯一能确定的是，想要继续追查，只能靠我们自己了。驻军的态度已经明朗，他们不会为我们提供任何帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我也不傻，我能看出来的，他们不使绊子都不错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下面我们怎么办啊？好不容易追到的线索又断了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得想想别的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对哦！我刚想起来，那个叫达米安的青年，他说他的工作是分拣土豆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每个移动城市周边的农用地块，都会有专门的往城里运送农作物的渠道哎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顺藤摸瓜的话，应该能找到务农人员的聚落，要是能和他的朋友或者亲属聊聊，线索说不定能续上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......很像你的思路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那打探消息的事情就交给我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很好，立刻行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，你要跟我一起去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我留下来和驻军交涉。我想，他们不会不经审讯就把人草草处决。只要有过审讯，就会有记录留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三角铁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，我们在城郊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们遇袭了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们突然冒了出来，我被发现了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这群人的作战手法和使用的武器都完全吻合之前的情报......小鼓的源石技艺都很难打中他们！该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记住，你的首要任务是活着回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "了解，队长！问题不大！三角铁通讯完毕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是重要情报。我们的目标，那支传说中鬼魂一样的部队，此刻就在小丘郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
